 SG_ Counter : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" Receiver,Observer
 SG_ Temperature : 16|16@1- (0.1,0) [-40|125] "degC" Receiver,Observer
 SG_ Voltage : 32|16@1+ (0.001,0) [0|5] "V" Receiver,Observer
 SG_ SyntheticTemperature : 48|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" Receiver,Observer
